academics specifically

00:37:24.740 --> 00:37:27.630
who become part of the
propaganda movement.

00:37:27.630 --> 00:37:31.690
Bloomin' traitors is one such academic,

00:37:31.690 --> 00:37:34.523
and we have streets named
after him here in Manila.

