00:45:07.520 --> 00:45:09.750
That is a different story
from the one that I'm telling.

00:45:09.750 --> 00:45:13.437
I was concerned with the
kind of really central

00:45:13.437 --> 00:45:16.780
and elite founding of
the Philippine nation

00:45:16.780 --> 00:45:19.480
and the way in which that's
embedded and reproduced

00:45:19.480 --> 00:45:23.340
