00:45:23.340 --> 00:45:26.460
and cosmopolitan Asian moorings,

00:45:26.460 --> 00:45:28.150
work in a way but are embedded there.

00:45:28.150 --> 00:45:29.990
And I wanted to show that

00:45:29.990 --> 00:45:32.470
just from the sort of the
more traditional sources

00:45:32.470 --> 00:45:34.950
without having to go all around.

00:45:34.950 --> 00:45:35.910
I think it's already there,

00:45:35.910 --> 00:45:37.897
