00:45:37.897 --> 00:45:41.393
by looking at these other actors.

00:45:43.010 --> 00:45:45.760
And I think the Mindanao
story is especially important.

00:45:47.360 --> 00:45:49.610
The reason why I would say that

00:45:51.001 --> 00:45:52.390
there's sort of this discursive link

00:45:52.390 --> 00:45:55.090
with a weaker institutional name,

00:45:55.090 --> 00:45:58.600
I think it's because of
American colonization

00:45:58.600 --> 00:46:03.600
and the American sort of colonial strategy

00:46:04.980 --> 00:46:06.900
of co-opting the elites

00:46:06.900 --> 00:46:11.270
to sort of take what was
a very charged Philippine

00:46:11.270 --> 00:46:12.971
