00:46:12.971 --> 00:46:17.971
and to channel it into
the sort of tutelage

00:46:18.400 --> 00:46:20.050
is very effective.

00:46:20.050 --> 00:46:21.600
And at the same time

00:46:21.600 --> 00:46:24.610
