continue to ally themselves

00:46:34.480 --> 00:46:35.530
with the US,

00:46:35.530 --> 00:46:37.627
to identify themselves in that way,

00:46:37.627 --> 00:46:39.941
depend themselves to the dollar,

00:46:39.941 --> 00:46:43.340
to cultivate that side.

00:46:43.340 --> 00:46:46.093
And those relationships make it such that,

00:46:47.350 --> 00:46:50.440
that's an investment that I think only

00:46:50.440 --> 00:46:53.100
