00:46:58.840 --> 00:46:59.673
However,

00:46:59.673 --> 00:47:03.740
I think even looking at
the contemporary scene,

00:47:03.740 --> 00:47:06.960
the sort of main state Philippine populace

00:47:06.960 --> 00:47:11.960
