00:52:28.070 --> 00:52:30.590
and when it's international lines,

00:52:30.590 --> 00:52:35.030
it's looked at in terms of
sort of relationship to Europe

00:52:35.030 --> 00:52:36.460
in terms of inspiration

00:52:36.460 --> 00:52:39.190
or it's internationalized comparatively,

00:52:39.190 --> 00:52:43.050
by looking at comparing it
to basically Puerto Rico,

00:52:43.050 --> 00:52:44.390
as an example for

00:52:46.000 --> 00:52:48.290
also a coordination thing from Spain to US

00:52:48.290 --> 00:52:49.870
and has a lot of the sort of the same

