cosmopolitanism, and travel,

00:55:07.080 --> 00:55:11.060
and another that's looks at
sort of nation and place.

00:55:11.060 --> 00:55:12.670
And it's seen as being more conservative.

00:55:12.670 --> 00:55:16.690
Whereas here, I think
that the two are sort of

00:55:17.700 --> 00:55:20.053
co constituted really, and are entangled.

